{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f8a28dbe-a95e-8059-b2fa-4dac72404216",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T10:25:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling about a catch basin. The grate is clogged up with sand, just packed with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "371 Eustis Avenue. That's up on the Hill. The basin is right at the curb in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 371 Eustis. And what's it doing, is the street flooding?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The water sits. There's a big puddle in the street, and it's been there since last Thursday. It hasn't rained, so it's not the weather. It just doesn't drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's been about six days with nothing coming down from the sky. Do you know why it's backed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:22:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the sand. From the winter road treatment. It washed down into the basin and filled it up. I can see it through the grate, it's nearly to the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. It happens this time of year. Has anybody looked at it yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I know of. I went out Saturday and pulled the leaves off the grate myself, by hand. That helped for about ten minutes. Then the water came right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:23:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, because the sand is underneath. Leaves are just the top layer. Please don't try to dig into it, though. It needs the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:23:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I didn't dig. I only did the leaves. I wouldn't go further than that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And is the water in the roadway only, or is it coming up toward your property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:23:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the roadway and the edge of the gutter. It's not at the house. But cars drive through it and it's getting icy at the edges in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note the ice. Let me get a work order started for the catch basin at 371 Eustis Avenue, sand-clogged, standing water since last Thursday. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Colleen Brennan. B-R-E-N-N-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Colleen. And a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0150. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "0150, got it. Just so I have it, how did you hear to call us about this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody at the store told me. I mentioned the puddle and they said, call Public Works. So I did."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, they steered you right. Okay, that's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will there be a work order, then? And do you have a date for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you'll have one. It's opened as I'm talking to you. The date, I'd say the crew gets to basins like this within the next week or so, and they work through them by area. If it's still sitting there after that, call me back and we'll bump it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Within the week. All right. And I just call this same number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same number, ask for Denise, or just mention the Eustis Avenue basin and anybody can pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Colleen. Stay off that icy patch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T10:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
